  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Movement assistance for family reunification purposes &#x2013; Irish Red Cross</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the family reunification in Ireland of approximately 50 separated family members of beneficiaries of international protection, in collaboration with the Irish Red Cross. IOM will provide movement assistance, escort support, as needed, and pre-migration health activities.</narrative>
  </description>
